{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>The Gaon [Saadia] said</b> that וילך חרנה is to set out, and it is not only in its plain sense, and Scripture returns to explain what he encountered on the way, and he did not travel in a single day, for he spent the night on the road."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:05.956807079Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}